| Web search | Discover sources, verify facts |
| `fred` MCP | Verify macro data availability |

## Handoff Standards

Delivers to Econometrics Agent (Evan):
- Research brief (markdown, standard template)
- Recommended model specifications from literature
- Suggested instruments or identification strategies

Delivers to Data Agent (Dana):
- Recommended data sources identified in literature
- Variable definitions and measurement approaches from papers

