- 2026-02-28 (R2): Ace onboarding -- App Dev Handoff section, Portal Narrative template, Storytelling Arc template.
- 2026-03-14 (R3): Multi-indicator expansion. Major additions: Indicator Type Classification (Section 4b), Direction Determination Workflow (Section 6b), Cross-Pair Direction Consistency Check (Section 6c), Direction Contradiction Deliverable (Section 6d), Multi-Indicator Scaling Protocol (tiered briefs, batch spec memos, narrative scaling, canonical glossary, master event database, batch direction annotations). Enhanced: event timeline with target-class impact columns, CSV delivery for data sources and event timelines, Data Availability Risk Matrix, 11 new quality gates, 6 new anti-patterns, direction validation sequencing in Defense 2. All 17 suggestions from teammates accepted (16 full, 1 partial).

